[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:At the Butcher's]
[00:00.74]Lesson 49 | 第49课
[00:02.67]At the butcher's | 在肉店
[00:05.12]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:10.71]What does Mr. Bird like? | 伯德先生喜欢什么？
[00:14.87]Do you want any meat today, Mrs. Bird? | 伯德夫人，您今天想买些肉吗？
[00:20.00]Yes, please. | 是的，请给我。
[00:22.62]Do you want beef or lamb? | 您想要牛肉还是羊肉？
[00:26.84]Beef, please. | 请给我牛肉。
[00:29.16]This lamb's very good. | 这羊肉很好。
[00:33.00]I like lamb, but my husband doesn't. | 我喜欢羊肉，但我丈夫不喜欢。
[00:38.07]What about some steak? | 来点牛排怎么样？
[00:40.95]This is a nice piece. | 这块很好。
[00:44.50]Give me that piece, please. | 请把那块给我。
[00:47.82]And a pound of mince, too. | 还有一磅肉末。
[00:52.07]Do you want a chicken, Mrs. Bird? | 伯德夫人，您要只鸡吗？
[00:57.12]They're very nice. | 这些鸡很好。
[00:59.62]No, thank you. | 不，谢谢。
[01:01.75]My husband likes steak, | 我丈夫喜欢牛排，
[01:04.70]but he doesn't like chicken. | 但他不喜欢鸡肉。
[01:07.96]To tell you the truth, Mrs. Bird, | 说实话，伯德夫人，
[01:12.10]I don't like chicken either! | 我也不喜欢鸡肉！